428 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 224 0 R /Rect [ 85.199997 386.648959 510.47998 745.688968 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure1) /TU (Flowchart detailing the selection process for a systematic review. Records identified: MEDLINE \(1680\), CENTRAL \(527\), Web of Science \(272\). After removing duplicates, 2455 records were screened. 2406 records were excluded as irrelevant. 49 full-text articles were assessed for eligibility; 30 excluded for reasons like not reporting outcomes of interest \(9\), duplicates \(2\), alternative treatments \(6\), unavailable full texts \(5\), and improper methods \(8\). Finally, 19 articles were included in both qualitative and quantitative syntheses. The flowchart sections are labeled as Identification, Screening, Eligibility, and Included.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
