<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 236 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 414.647982 538.617004 745.367984 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure9) /TU (A forest plot showing a meta-analysis of three subgroups: oligopeptides, polypeptides, and tripeptides. Each study lists baseline and end means, mean differences, confidence intervals, and weights. The oligopeptides subgroup has four studies, polypeptides have eight, and tripeptides have one. The plot includes a diamond representing the random effects model for each subgroup and overall. Heterogeneity and statistical test results are noted, with total weights and confidence intervals in bold.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
